# Auto publish

After completing any code change requested by Vinicius:

1. Commit the changes with a concise message focused on why.
2. Push to `origin` immediately.
3. Do not ask whether to commit or push — just publish.

Only skip commit/push when the user explicitly says not to, or when there are no changes to publish.
